          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Multi-dimensional data cube structure using DDI-CDI. Typed as ada:dataCube and cdi:StructuredDataSet per CDIF 2026 alignment.
:title: "Data Cube Type"
:prefix: ``cdif``
:typeSchema: {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}, "allOf": [{"contains": {"const": "cdi:StructuredDataSet"}}]}
:typeOptional:
:noId:</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.cdifDataType.cdifDataCube.DataCube"/>
        </ownedComment>
